    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with an attack roll that is unable to hit more than one creature, you may deal additional fire damage to it equal to your proficiency bonus. You may use this attunement once per turn. You can also use the Flametongue totem power.</p><p>At 9th level, you gain resistance to fire damage.</p>",
